<Base title="Privacy Policy | Break 90 Golf" description="How Break 90 Golf handles newsletter signups, Google Analytics, hosting data and links to external websites."><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 15, 2026.</p><p>Break 90 Golf is an informational website.</p><p>If you subscribe to our newsletter, your email address will be processed by Buttondown, the provider identified at signup for the purpose of sending requested emails. You can unsubscribe using the link in any newsletter.</p><p>Our hosting provider may process technical request data to operate and secure the website. </p><h2>Website analytics</h2><p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand website traffic, which articles people read, how visitors reach the site, and interactions such as clicks to external websites. Google Analytics uses cookies and collects information such as pages visited, device and browser details, referral information and approximate location. We configure our website tag with Google signals and advertising personalization disabled.</p><p>We do not intentionally send newsletter email addresses or other directly identifying contact details to Google Analytics. Our newsletter provider processes subscriptions separately. Analytics may be limited by browser settings, privacy tools or your choices. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google’s Privacy Policy</a> and the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a> for more information and controls.</p><p>External product and affiliate links lead to third-party websites that have their own privacy practices. See our <a href="/about/">editorial approach</a> for information about the publication.</p></div></section></Base>
